# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the lead's three sounds, a Preset's each (P1 Swell, P2 Glass, P3
# Reed), on the progression page over a chord at Snap 80: a short phrase, then a long note pressed harder and back
# (brighter, more vibrato). Not a test of its own.
